DESCRIPTION:Bike lanes aren't just for bikes\; they’re mobility lanes. S
 afe\, connected infrastructure means access and independence for people of
  all abilities. Join us for the ACCESS FOR ALL ride on OCTOBER 31'st. Meet
 up at 10am at Christie Pits and rollout at 10:30am.\n\nDetails\n\n* Date: 
 October 31\n* Time: 10:00 AM meet-up\, 10:30 AM roll out\n* Meeting Locati
